Registers VK_STLX_surface, extension 1001 under the STLX tag, for the
stellux platform that VK_USE_PLATFORM_STELLUX_STLX selects, and adds
VK_ICD_WSI_PLATFORM_STELLUX and the stellux choice of the platforms option.
The structure type joins VkStructureType in vulkan_core.h, as every
supported Vulkan extension's does, platform ones included, and
vulkan_stellux.h names libstlxwin's connection and window by their struct
tags, so it includes no libstlxwin header.

